==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 8.67~14.67 seconds<sup>260f~440f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.
*200 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

